Amendment from September 22, 2020 Public Services
Committee Meeting

ORDINANCE – Amending various sections of Chapter 15.50, Historic Design Guidelines, of Title
15, Buildings and Construction, of the Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming.
Amended by substitute dated September 18, 2020.  The substitute provides clarity of the
application and approval process in the ordinance involving structure alterations, improvements
and new construction.
```
